   "_id": 21097,
   "ANSWER": "<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong>User program requests system call (API).</strong></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong>Trap instruction switches to kernel mode.</strong></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong>Kernel identifies and executes the requested service.</strong></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong>Result (if any) is returned to user program.</strong></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><strong>Control switches back to user mode.</strong></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
